  "panels": [
    {
      "id": 1,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "操作 QPS",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "sum by (operation) (rate(memory_operations_total{operation=~\"$operation\", status=\"ok\"}[$__rate_interval]))",
          "legendFormat": "{{operation}}"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "ops",
          "color": {
            "mode": "palette-classic"
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "list",
          "placement": "bottom",
          "showLegend": true
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi",
          "sort": "desc"
        }
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 8,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 0
      },
      "description": "各 memory 操作（search/recall/add/list/count/consolidate）的成功请求速率，反映 memory 子系统整体负载。异常排查：\n1. 先确认是真实异常还是数据缺失：访问 Prometheus Targets（http://localhost:9090/targets）确认 stock-agent 抓取正常，curl http://localhost:8013/metrics 确认 memory_operations_total 存在。\n2. 若 QPS 归零：查看服务是否存活/重启过（docker compose ps stock-agent、docker compose logs stock-agent），服务重启会导致计数器清零。\n3. 若某个 operation 暴涨：add 暴涨查是否有重复触发记忆写入（看 memory_write 节点日志），search/recall 暴涨查前端或 Agent 是否高频调用。\n4. 修复后观察 1~2 个抓取周期（30s）内 QPS 是否恢复；若服务正常仍归零，检查 prometheus.yml 的 target 地址与端口映射。"
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "整体错误率",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "sum(rate(memory_operations_total{operation=~\"$operation\", status=\"error\"}[$__rate_interval])) / sum(rate(memory_operations_total{operation=~\"$operation\"}[$__rate_interval]))"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "percentunit",
          "color": {
            "mode": "thresholds"
          },
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "green",
                "value": null
              },
              {
                "color": "red",
                "value": 0.01
              }
            ]
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "colorMode": "value",
        "graphMode": "area",
        "justifyMode": "auto",
        "orientation": "auto",
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ],
          "fields": "",
          "values": false
        }
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 8,
        "x": 8,
        "y": 0
      },
      "description": "所有 memory 操作中失败请求的占比，正常应接近 0；持续大于 1% 说明有系统性问题。异常排查：\n1. 先看趋势排除瞬时抖动（单次 500 或超时不算异常），确认错误率是否持续 5 分钟以上。\n2. 查日志定位错误类型：docker compose logs stock-agent | grep -iE 'memory|error'，看是 MySQL/Qdrant 连接错误还是参数校验/代码异常。\n3. 按依赖逐个验证：MySQL（docker compose exec mysql mysqladmin ping）、Qdrant（curl localhost:6333/healthz）、Redis（记忆检索链路）。\n4. 修复依赖或代码后观察错误率回落；若仍高，用 operation 维度拆分定位是哪个操作在失败。"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "操作延迟 P95",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "histogram_quantile(0.95, sum(rate(memory_operation_duration_seconds_bucket{operation=~\"$operation\"}[$__rate_interval])) by (le, operation))",
          "legendFormat": "{{operation}}"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "s",
          "color": {
            "mode": "palette-classic"
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "list",
          "placement": "bottom",
          "showLegend": true
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi",
          "sort": "desc"
        }
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 8,
        "x": 16,
        "y": 0
      },
      "description": "各 memory 操作耗时 P95 分位，用来定位是写库、向量检索还是整合环节变慢。异常排查：\n1. 确认是否伴随错误率上升（通常是依赖超时导致的假象）。\n2. 看是哪个操作慢：add 慢查 MySQL 写入和 Qdrant upsert；search/recall 慢查 Qdrant 查询与 embedding 计算；list/count 慢查 MySQL 索引（user_id+namespace+status 组合）是否命中。\n3. 对照 Qdrant 延迟面板和 MySQL 慢查询日志（docker compose exec mysql 查 slow log）。\n4. 针对性优化：加索引、调小 Qdrant top_k、扩大连接池；修复后观察 P95 回落。"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "写入动作分布",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "sum by (action) (rate(memory_writes_total{memory_type=~\"$memory_type\"}[$__rate_interval]))",
          "legendFormat": "{{action}}"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "ops",
          "color": {
            "mode": "palette-classic"
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
